      "Direct effects are fitted in a profile model with a diagonal covariance",
      "(EEI or VVI); they are not combined with %s."),
      paste(names(conflicts)[conflicts], collapse = ", ")),
      class = "latents_bad_argument", call = NULL))
  }
  invisible(NULL)
}

